---
import LegalPage from '../components/astro/LegalPage.astro';
import dealership from '../data/dealership.json';
import { telHref } from '../lib/format';
const d = dealership;
---
<LegalPage title="Accessibility" path="/accessibility" updated="2026-10-02"
  description="How the RV Farm website is built to be easy to read and use, and how to tell us about a problem.">
  <p>We want everyone to be able to use this site, including on an older phone, with a screen reader, or with the text made larger.</p>
  <h2>What we’ve done</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Built to meet the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.2 level AA, checked with automated tests on every page before each update goes live.</li>
    <li>Large body text (17–18 px), high-contrast colours, and buttons at least 44 px tall.</li>
    <li>Works with a keyboard alone; visible focus outlines; labels above every form field.</li>
    <li>Pinch-to-zoom is never blocked.</li>
    <li>Animation is minimal and turns off if your device asks for reduced motion, or with the “Reduce motion” button at the bottom of every page.</li>
    <li>Our phone number is written out as text on every page.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Tell us about a problem</h2>
  <p>If something on this site is hard to use, call <a href={telHref(d.phones.main)}>{d.phones.main}</a> and we’ll help you directly and fix the page. This statement is part of our commitment under the Accessibility for Ontarians with Disabilities Act (AODA).</p>
</LegalPage>
